      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. i don't really want to go back to the doctor every week for blood tests though, it's such a hassle. since it's just a supplement and not a medicine, can i just keep taking it and if i feel fine im good? like, if i'm not bleeding or anything, does that mean the dose is fine?",
