      "content": "i get that it's important, but i really hate the doctor visits. honestly, if i just take a smaller amount of the vitamin k, like half a dose or even just every other day, wouldn't that be enough to help my bones without messing up my warfarin too much? i just want a way to manage this myself without all the constant blood work.",
